<!--Post: 511--><!--Time: 1090158829-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST511"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Russell<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, July 18, 2004 - 6:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, Profile Yourself AT NO RISK <BR> <BR>... At least there is no more risk than mailing a letter. This is a character profile, not a typical statistics-based FBI profile. I posted this general offer on the Kansas message board last month, but received no response. Perhaps, you missed it. I do believe you are curious about your cognitive, behavioral, existential functioning. This is what the BRACE Character Profile measures. <BR> <BR>In any case, if you are serious about being accurately known or understanding yourself better, rate yourself on the 75-item 5-point rating scale known as the BRACE Character Profile. The 75 input ratings and the instructions are available at BRACEanalysis.com. You can even practice by rating Dr. Hannibal Lecter. Once you view the simple instructions and the profile items, all you need to do is rate yourself for each of the 75 items and e-mail or snail mail the corresponding ratings according to the “contact us” address at BRACEanalysis.com. You can view a profile of you that was developed in a message board at DeviantCrimes.com, Serial Crimes, Serial Murders section. <BR> <BR>Be sure to include how you want the results of your self-profile to be communicated to you ... the results can be posted on the internet, mailed to the newspaper or TV station of your choice, etc. no contact by you required. <BR> <BR>Of course, nothing will be confidential. And, I will need proof it is you.  <BR> <BR>SUMMARY: <BR>1.  No more risk than mailing a letter. <BR>2.  Rate yourself on the 75 items of the BRACE Character Profile. <BR>3.  You can view input ratings at BRACEanalysis.com,  <BR>4.  All I need are your ratings corresponding to the 75 items, e-mailed or snail mailed to me. Or, you can send them to the media, etc. <BR>5.  You can view a profile of you completed on the message board at DevianCrimes.com in the Serial Crimes/Serial Murders section. <BR>6.  Be sure to designate how you want your self-profile communicated to you through any third party. <BR>7.  Nothing will be confidential. <BR>8.  I will need proof it is you. <BR> <BR>Bottom line is that all I need are your 75 ratings, proof it is you, and instructions on what to do with the results. <BR> <BR>Russell <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 511-->
<!--Post: 512--><!--Time: 1090166893-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST512"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Mike_kelleher<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Mike_kelleher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, July 18, 2004 - 9:08 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You didn&#39;t mention how much BTK will pay for this profile. For the sake of completeness, would you like to add this important information? I was unable to find it on your website, other than the reference to PayPal at the end of the question section.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
