<!--Post: 540--><!--Time: 1090441868-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST540"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Muskogee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Muskogee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, July 21, 2004 - 1:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Geez!  I&#39;m in the wrong business... <BR> <BR>Here, Mike: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.braceanalysis.com/clientarea.html" target=_top>http://www.braceanalysis.com/clientarea.html</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 540-->
<!--Post: 541--><!--Time: 1090451516-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST541"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Mike_kelleher<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Mike_kelleher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, July 21, 2004 - 4:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks, Muskogee. It&#39;s an interesting fee schedule. In the public interest, I wonder if Russell would provide his BRACE profile on this site so we can have a look at it. That would give us all a chance to determine how it works, its worth, and its relevance.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 541-->
<!--Post: 542--><!--Time: 1090502689-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST542"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Russell<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Russell<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 22, 2004 - 6:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->For a sample BRACE Character Profile, see the FAQ section of BRACEanalysis.com for the profile of Dr. Lecter. You can actually practice profiling Lecter to see how it works. Or, go to DeviantCrimes.com to see the profile analysis of BTK in the Serial Crimes/Serial Murder section. The input ratings for this profile were developed on their message board. <BR> <BR>A careful reading of my initial post makes it clear that all BTK has to do is view the input profile and put his self-ratings on a piece of paper and mail it according to the contact instructions at BRACEanalysis.com. He would never go to PayPal. <BR> <BR>Russell<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 542-->
<!--Post: 549--><!--Time: 1090538686-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST549"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Mike_kelleher<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Mike_kelleher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 22, 2004 - 4:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well, I guess that answers my question about posting it on this site.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
